<title>FRANCE: Man takes 35 hostages in central Paris.</title>
<headline>Man takes 35 hostages in central Paris.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A man took 35 people hostage in central Paris on Friday, police said.</p>
<p>French TF1 television said two people were injured when the unidentified man took the hostages on the fourth floor of a building in Boulevard Haussmann near the Paris opera house. No other details were immediately available.</p>
